OL,3,GNEWSAWhat will get unsure cyclists back
OL,4,Aon the saddle?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising fuel prices and concerns about
OL,7,Fthe environment are pushing some people
OL,8,Ftowards getting on their bike instead
OL,9,Fof behind the wheel. However, not
OL,10,Feveryone feels confident in doing so.
OL,11,FWhat challenges do they face in
OL,12,FSuffolk?
OL,14,FGala Fraser Lim, 18, was riding home
OL,15,Ffrom her job at the Gainsborough Sports
OL,16,FCentre in Ipswich when she was knocked
OL,17,Foff her bicycle by a car earlier this
OL,18,Fyear.
OL,20,FIt destroyed her set of wheels and
OL,21,Fdamaged her confidence.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
